      "$comment_atlas": "The 3D atlas (ADR 0017). Subject and selection are sun gold: the one colour that stands clear of both the blue sea and green land. Highlight states are semantic: subject is the country being asked about, selected is a learner or Explore choice, correct/incorrect follow the verdict â€” incorrect is plum, never red. Borders are pale lines over the relief texture, the halo is the atmosphere, labelInk/labelHalo are live text over the globe.",
